      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹66.81 (vs ₹42.52 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹66.81 (up from ₹42.52 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.39b (up 41% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹326.2m (up 65% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.1% (up from 4.3% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 41% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
